WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.015
The Barbary pirates ran toward their ship.

2
00:00:04.016 --> 00:00:08.526
"Hurry! Everyone help me!" Dr. Dolittle shouted.

3
00:00:08.527 --> 00:00:12.083
"What is that man saying?" one pirate asked.

4
00:00:12.084 --> 00:00:16.995
"He seems to be speaking a strange language," answered the captain.

5
00:00:16.996 --> 00:00:19.148
"It’s moving! It’s moving!"

6
00:00:19.149 --> 00:00:22.660
Gub-Gub jumped up and down.

7
00:00:22.661 --> 00:00:25.562
But the pirates were fast runners.

8
00:00:25.564 --> 00:00:28.337
They got onto Dr. Dolittle’s boat.

9
00:00:28.338 --> 00:00:33.606
"Ah-ha! You think you can escape from me?" laughed the captain.

10
00:00:33.607 --> 00:00:35.978
"We will take your boat!"

11
00:00:35.979 --> 00:00:42.404
"Oh, but . . . ," Gub-Gub was about to tell them the boat was no good.

12
00:00:42.405 --> 00:00:46.886
"See? Those rats were lying!" shouted Dab-Dab.

13
00:00:46.887 --> 00:00:49.175
"That boat is not sinking!"

14
00:00:49.176 --> 00:00:54.162
Sure enough, Dr. Dolittle’s boat began chasing the pirate ship.

15
00:00:54.163 --> 00:00:58.935
Dr. Dolittle could hear the pirates’ laughter.

16
00:00:58.936 --> 00:01:03.058
Dr. Dolittle had never been on a pirate ship before.

17
00:01:03.059 --> 00:01:05.346
He did the best he could.

18
00:01:05.347 --> 00:01:07.939
The animals tried to help him.

19
00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:11.452
But the pirates were catching up.

20
00:01:11.453 --> 00:01:17.480
The captain of the pirates shouted at them, "You are fast, but I am faster!

21
00:01:17.481 --> 00:01:19.375
I am the great Ben Ali!

22
00:01:19.376 --> 00:01:21.478
I am the Barbary Dragon!"

23
00:01:21.479 --> 00:01:27.459
Then he laughed an ugly laugh.

24
00:01:27.460 --> 00:01:33.886
"Dr. Dolittle! They’re getting close!" cried Dab-Dab.

25
00:01:33.887 --> 00:01:37.011
The pirates started to sing a terrible song.

26
00:01:37.012 --> 00:01:39.124
"A pig we’ll have tonight!

27
00:01:39.125 --> 00:01:41.138
A big fat pig cooked right.

28
00:01:41.139 --> 00:01:46.551
With carrots and stew and butter too, we’ll eat till morning light."

29
00:01:46.552 --> 00:01:51.337
Poor Gub-Gub was so scared he burst into tears.

30
00:01:51.338 --> 00:01:53.468
"That boat is NOT sinking!

31
00:01:53.469 --> 00:01:58.203
The rats lied!" Dab-Dab shouted angrily.

32
00:01:58.204 --> 00:02:01.728
The pirates saw Dab-Dab jumping up and down.

33
00:02:01.729 --> 00:02:04.458
They started to sing a new song.

34
00:02:04.459 --> 00:02:06.339
"Ducks are yummy, too.

35
00:02:06.340 --> 00:02:08.648
We’ll put them in our stew.

36
00:02:08.649 --> 00:02:11.156
His head and feet will be a treat.

37
00:02:11.157 --> 00:02:13.622
Yummy duck for me and you!"

38
00:02:13.623 --> 00:02:18.606
Poor Dab-Dab was so scared that he fainted.

39
00:02:18.607 --> 00:02:23.630
Ben Ali, the Barbary Dragon, sailed the boat right next to their ship.

40
00:02:23.631 --> 00:02:25.452
"I say we fight them!

41
00:02:25.453 --> 00:02:28.232
Come on!" growled Jip.

42
00:02:28.233 --> 00:02:29.843
"But they have swords.

43
00:02:29.844 --> 00:02:33.117
We have nothing," Dr. Dolittle said.

44
00:02:33.118 --> 00:02:38.577
"I have horns sharper than swords," said the usually quiet pushmi-pullyu.

45
00:02:38.579 --> 00:02:42.001
He was sharpening all his horns.

46
00:02:42.002 --> 00:02:45.344
All of a sudden, the pirates felt their boat move.

47
00:02:45.345 --> 00:02:48.539
"What was that?" shouted Ben Ali.

48
00:02:48.540 --> 00:02:50.871
He stared at his feet.

49
00:02:50.872 --> 00:02:53.592
"This boat is SINKING!" he yelled.

50
00:02:53.593 --> 00:02:56.813
The boat sank lower and lower.

51
00:02:56.814 --> 00:03:00.522
"That’s impossible!" one pirate cried out.

52
00:03:00.523 --> 00:03:03.293
"I didn’t see the rats leave the boat!"

53
00:03:03.294 --> 00:03:06.008
Jip jumped up and down with joy.

54
00:03:06.009 --> 00:03:11.120
"That’s because they left hours ago!" he laughed.

55
00:03:11.121 --> 00:03:16.526
But of course the pirates only heard a dog barking loudly.

56
00:03:16.527 --> 00:03:19.705
Ben Ali and the other pirates started to panic.

57
00:03:19.706 --> 00:03:21.674
No one was singing now.

58
00:03:21.675 --> 00:03:26.180
"Ha-ha! Come and catch me if you can," teased Gub-Gub.

59
00:03:26.181 --> 00:03:30.327
Dab-Dab stuck his tongue out at them.

60
00:03:30.328 --> 00:03:32.828
The pirates climbed onto the sails.

61
00:03:32.829 --> 00:03:35.236
The boat sank deeper and deeper.

62
00:03:35.237 --> 00:03:37.425
They grabbed onto the sails.

63
00:03:37.426 --> 00:03:39.597
Some held onto the ropes.

64
00:03:39.598 --> 00:03:41.443
But it was no use.

65
00:03:41.444 --> 00:03:43.875
The boat disappeared into the water.

66
00:03:43.876 --> 00:03:50.152
The pirates splashed around in the water.

